21 0 obj
<</A 1234 0 R /Alt
  (Two screens of a smartphone application, side by side. The left screen shows the gallery with photos taken within the app \(hot air balloons, mountains, a man playing guitar at a stage, a man doing a barbecue next to a road, three colorful trees, a dog on\ the sand, a shirtless man in canoe in a river, three people smiling\), while the right screen shows a vocabulary page containing  three panels laid vertically: the top one shows the main photograph in which a man is doing a barbecue next to a road, the m\iddle shows one button with the phrase "everyone had a great time there" written and also represented by three symbols \(five people's heads, a stick figure with thumbs up, and an hourglass\), and the bottom shows a grid with vocabulary buttons composed o\f the written word and its symbol: grill, meat, family, hungry, burn, burger, street, proud, try, game, vegetable, tasty.)
  /K [10 354 0 R] /P 8 0 R /Pg 355 0 R /S /Figure /T ()>>
endobj
