<</A 1224 0 R /Alt
  (A line graph illustrating precision-recall curves for four different combination of parameters similarity threshold and vocabulary selection and a baseline. The combination "0_all" is on the top of all others, indicating higher precision at all levels of \recall. The combination "0_exemplars" presents the second best precision when recall is lower than 0.12, and third best with higher values of recall. Other configurations are slightly worst. All configurations perform substantially better than the baselin\e )
  /ID (AD000000-0000-0000-ADBE-       14843) /K 4 /P 8 0 R /Pg 681 0 R
  /S /Figure>>
